CM_ SG_ 1285 A1_ThermalOverWarn "1 = board temperature above the warn limit (msg 3 byte 7 bit 0)";
CM_ SG_ 1285 A1_ThermalCritSoon "1 = board temperature within the critical-soon margin of the critical limit (bit 1)";
CM_ SG_ 1285 A1_ThermalCritical "1 = critical: all outputs held off except the exempt ones (bit 2)";
